    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bitūnja ba ng'wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo, ū Yuda akabaleka a biye ūja kwikala na ngosha ūmò muna Adulamu, lina lyakwe Hiila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūbona ko nkīma, nshīke wa ngosha nebe muna Kanaani, witanagwa Shua; ūntoola ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūbiza nke wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mayū ng'wenūyo ūbūūcha nda, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, ū ise ūng'wilīka Eeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbūūcha nda yīngī, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha hangī, ū nina ūng'wilīka ī lina lyakwe Onani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbyala na ūngī, nang'hwe ngosha, lina lyakwe Sheela; nū ng'wene akilīkwa na nina. Aho alīmyala baalī Kezibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūntooja ū Eeli, ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū wa kwandya; ū nkīma witanagwa Tamali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Eeli, ū ng'witūja wa kwandya wa ng'wa Yuda, walī na nhūngwa jabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yuda ūng'wīla ū Onani gīkī, “Ng'wingīlage ū nke wa nkūlūyo, ūng'wītīle ū nkwelayo ūmo shilī shīmīle, ūmūkīje būbyīle ū nkūlūyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Onani walī amanile gīkī ū būbyīle būtūbiza bokwe, na lūūlū būlī ikanza ūlū walaala nū nkwelaye, ī mbīyū wajiitīlaga ha būlīīlī, gīkī atizūmūkīja būbyīle ū nkūlūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo wagwītaga gwenūyo gwalī gwabūbi no ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, na lūūlū nū ng'wene ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yuda ūng'wīla ū ng'wīnga wakwe ū Tamali gīkī, “Jaga kū ng'wing'we,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kū ng'wing'we:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kū kaya ya ng'wa so.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūkikale ūmo bakikalīga bachīlwa, kūshisha ū ng'witūnja wane ū Sheela akūle.” Ū gwenūyo akagūhaya nguno wiganikaga gīkī, “Atizūcha nū ng'wenūyū gītī bakūlūye.” Ng'hana ū Tamali ūja kū ng'wawe ūkikala kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yuda na Tamali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jūbīta shikū ningī, kwimanīla wazumalīka ū nke wa ng'wa Yuda, ū nshīke wa ng'wa Shua. Aho lyabīta ī likanza lya kūnīla ū nke, ū Yuda ūbūūka nū nwani ng'wiye ū Hiila ū muna Adulamu, būja Timna kūlola banhū babutīlaga ng'holo jakwe booya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Tamali ūwīlwa gīkī, “Ū so būkwi akūbīta ajile Timna, kūbutīla ng'holo jakwe booya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nshīke akabona gīkī, nūūlū īkī ū Sheela walī wakūla, alīyo walī atinhagwa ū kūlī we bitoole; hūna lūūlū ūshizuula ī shizwalo shakwe ī sha būchīīlwa, wigubba ng'wenda ū kū būshū gīkī ajimīīlīke; ūūkigasha ha mita gwa Enaimu, gwalī haho nī nzīla ya kūja Timna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda aho wamona igashije, wiganika gīkī wabona malahya, nguno walī wigubbanīja ng'wenda ū kū būshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūliga hoi, atūmanaga gīkī hū ng'wene ū ng'wīnga wakwe. Aho wang'wegeela ūng'wīla, “Bebe mayū, nalikūmva kūlaala nang'ho!” Nang'hwe ūnshokeja, “Ūlīhaya kūlaala nane, ūkūninha kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Nakūkūtūmīla kagulyati ka mbūli kūfuma kwidaale lya mitugo jane.” Ū nkīma ūng'wīla, “Ūleega shikolo kī ī sha kūnilekela kūshisha aho ūlanenhele?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbūja, “Ūlītogwa neege shikolo kī?” Ū nshīke ūshosha, “Ninhage ī limeng'helo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Limeng'helo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ka shikolo ka kūmeng'hela mitugo ja basabi bamò na bamò. Ī kale bakatungaga ha ngufu, bakanungeleja mu nhingo; bayūyeela nako.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lyako lyenīlo, nū ngufu gwalyo, nū nang'ha ūyo ūlīnago mu nkono.” Ūng'winha ī shikolo shenīsho, hūna ūlaala nang'hwe; ūngeta nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīnga dūhū a henaho ū nkīma ng'wenūyo, ūkagwīnja ū ng'wenda ūyo walī wigubba, ūzwala hangī ī myenda yakwe ī ya nyachīīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda atadīlile, ūng'winha a kagulyati ka mbūli ū nwani ng'wiye ū muna Adulamu, ūntūma akatwale ū kūlī nkīma ng'wenūyo, akashikomoole ī shikolo shakwe; alīyo atampandīkile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgema kūbabūja bagosha bamò na bamò ba ng'wenūmo gīkī, “Bing'we bagosha, alī halī ū malahya ūyo walikalaga igashije bbihī na nzīla ha mita gwa Enaimu?” Būng'wīla, “Atīmo malahya ū ng'wenūmu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkalīla kūshoka dūhū ū kūlī Yuda, ūkang'wīla gīkī, “Nangayiwa nīyo na a bagosha ba ng'wenūmo bahaya, ‘Atīnilonga malahya ū ng'wenūmu!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūhaya, “I, yene shacha būjikū, nekage atwale ī shikolo shenīsho, tūkūgookela midūhū. Ū nene natogilwe ū kūng'winha a kagulyati; h'ī chene naalī nakwinha ūntwalīle, alīyo wakangayiwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pelezi na Zeela kūbyalwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta myeji idatū ūwīlwa ū Yuda gīkī, “Ū ng'wīnga wako wandije būmalahya, nīyo ī haha wagetilwe na nda.” Ū Yuda ūhaya, “Nfunyagi hanze, abūlagwe bo kūpemva mu moto!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo aho alīfunyiwa, ūntūmīla nhūng'wa ū nkwīye ūhaya gīkī, “Ū ng'wenekīlī shikolo īshi, hū ng'wene wanigetile ī nda.” Ongeja na gīkī, “Nalīlomba ūlīlole ī limeng'helo īlī nū ngufu gwalyo, nū nang'ha ūyū, ūlū ūkūng'witegeleja ū ng'wenesho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 38:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yuda ūshideeba; hūna ūhaya gīkī, “Ū wei ntūngīlīja kūtinda ū nene, nguno natang'winhile ū kūlī ng'witūnja wane ū Sheela.” Atalaalile nang'hwe hangī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
